# Per-run eye-check screenshots left by the ui-harness layout checks.
/ui-snapshots/
# The same three for every application of the workspace: Playwright writes its
# artifacts beside the config that ran it, and the console's config lives in its
# own project directory. The entries above are anchored here and do not reach it.
# Spelled out rather than globbed: an anchored pattern is matched literally by
# the gate that checks this file, so a new application of the workspace adds its
# own three lines.
/projects/console-web/test-results
/projects/console-web/playwright-report
/projects/console-web/ui-snapshots/
